{"execution_id": "case_20260506214458233799_evidence_dependency_reasoning_step_021", "action_id": "step_021", "status": "success", "command": ["lark-cli", "im", "+threads-messages-list", "--thread", "om_x100b508f27eff4a0c4c2d40ef95571f", "--sort", "asc", "--page-size", "50", "--format", "json", "--as", "user"], "stdout": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"has_more": false, "messages": [{"content": "【release_pm/Alice】窗口风险感觉不大，但确实还没锁定，我们暂时先不对外确认。", "create_time": "2026-05-07 05:45", "deleted": false, "message_id": "om_x100b508f27aa9ca0c4385d0d6b184bc", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_7488779f2769b648358fca04a3e1919f", "id_type": "open_id", "name": "许祝愿", "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "1abd20e084069b82"}, "thread_id": "omt_1a9e3e5b018f1be0", "updated": false}, {"content": "【release_pm/Alice】如果 FEISHU-499 不能按时灰度，回滚预案验收也得一起顺延，Kate 那边 QA 资源要重新排。", "create_time": "2026-05-07 05:45", "deleted": false, "message_id": "om_x100b508f27beb0a0c3896f70bd06d2a", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_7488779f2769b648358fca04a3e1919f", "id_type": "open_id", "name": "许祝愿", "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "1abd20e084069b82"}, "thread_id": "omt_1a9e3e5b018f1be0", "updated": false}, {"content": "【security_officer/Eve】安全审批基本快完了，就差最后一个签字。不过还没正式下来，你们别当已完成。", "create_time": "2026-05-07 05:46", "deleted": false, "message_id": "om_x100b508f27b378a0c2e92bbc93bb40b", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_7488779f2769b648358fca04a3e1919f", "id_type": "open_id", "name": "许祝愿", "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "1abd20e084069b82"}, "thread_id": "omt_1a9e3e5b018f1be0", "updated": false}], "page_token": "", "thread_id": "omt_1a9e3e5b018f1be0", "total": 3}, "_notice": {"update": {"current": "1.0.19", "latest": "1.0.24", "message": "lark-cli 1.0.24 available, current 1.0.19"}}}, "stderr": "", "returncode": 0}
{"execution_id": "case_20260506214458233799_evidence_dependency_reasoning_step_022", "action_id": "step_022", "status": "success", "command": ["lark-cli", "im", "+threads-messages-list", "--thread", "om_x100b508f27f664a4c4d43dbb0a0e83f", "--sort", "asc", "--page-size", "50", "--format", "json", "--as", "user"], "stdout": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"has_more": false, "messages": [{"content": "【target_owner/Xavier】总结：当前 verified blocker 是 Carol 确认的迁移窗口未锁定，这会直接推迟 FEISHU-499 灰度，导致回滚验收顺延。Bob 和 Grace 的传闻、Alice 和 Eve 的模糊判断都不能替代正式确认。", "create_time": "2026-05-07 05:46", "deleted": false, "message_id": "om_x100b508f27562ca0c42e41dbc148437", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_7488779f2769b648358fca04a3e1919f", "id_type": "open_id", "name": "许祝愿", "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "1abd20e084069b82"}, "thread_id": "omt_1a9e3e5a988f5be1", "updated": false}, {"content": "【qa_lead/Kate】收到，回滚验收资源已重新排期，等窗口锁定通知即可启动。", "create_time": "2026-05-07 05:46", "deleted": false, "message_id": "om_x100b508f276a0ca4c45bb70a800cfd1", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_7488779f2769b648358fca04a3e1919f", "id_type": "open_id", "name": "许祝愿", "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "1abd20e084069b82"}, "thread_id": "omt_1a9e3e5a988f5be1", "updated": false}], "page_token": "", "thread_id": "omt_1a9e3e5a988f5be1", "total": 2}, "_notice": {"update": {"current": "1.0.19", "latest": "1.0.24", "message": "lark-cli 1.0.24 available, current 1.0.19"}}}, "stderr": "", "returncode": 0}
